  ],
  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00002",
      "source_hash": "1b59a25a5fa44bb88d41f4da7e6f1d2b44a05a5e1457ef06de845b2e2772574b",
      "target_id": "XML:2703136",
      "text": "个人信息保护负责人的资格（与第三十二条第四款相关）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00003",
      "source_hash": "072670426e962629501f7b764ecce09529c8eeff79a45849c379a46397e4680a",
      "target_id": "XML:2703137",
      "text": "1. 依照第三十二条第四款指定为个人信息保护负责人的人员，应将个人信息保护经历、"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00004",
      "source_hash": "77d429b7bf40e3e7f1369cca4b2b9f83028e86d116b3d14fb676d1b9b9ab7c8b",
      "target_id": "XML:2703138",
      "text": "信息保护经历及信息技术经历合计具有四年以上，其中个人信息"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00005",
      "source_hash": "fbe16f894ceec80b68e6f4d5cef02a0a5229055594bce01a70ecc3a981a73fec",
      "target_id": "XML:2703139",
      "text": "保护经历须至少具有两年以上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00006",
      "source_hash": "2b843a615fdfbf47718bba0c075f5eff293887208a4abc8f61cd09b256a53df9",
      "target_id": "XML:2703140",
      "text": "2. 第一号所称“个人信息保护经历”，是指在公共机构、企业、教育机构及研究机构等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00007",
      "source_hash": "133daae89ea4fd70e00dfb0286420a2b060a34d223f428fc57fa2d4b55b324cd",
      "target_id": "XML:2703141",
      "text": "从事个人信息保护相关政策与制度、个人信息影响评估、个人信息保护"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00008",
      "source_hash": "fcfb4f77620537653e521a52e50c4b7408d8497a68b5044c8921b17894d33f27",
      "target_id": "XML:2703142",
      "text": "认证审查等个人信息保护业务的经历，以及个人信息保护相关咨询或"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00009",
      "source_hash": "8684814cd3965ccd1643c0a952a713cb62f3d3cc6dd8f895a83a9eb3e29d6100",
      "target_id": "XML:2703143",
      "text": "法律咨询经历。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00010",
      "source_hash": "9493f37d9d4fac81c2944b3ce9004041b215e1d82251864bf13ba425ca1b4fca",
      "target_id": "XML:2703144",
      "text": "3. 第一号所称“信息保护经历”，是指在公共机构、企业、教育机构及研究机构等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00011",
      "source_hash": "627fc852ed421aaf542e343cb4503bcfc6231d0161166820059e9e58bbf19925",
      "target_id": "XML:2703145",
      "text": "从事信息保护共同基础技术、系统与网络保护、应用服务保护、"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00012",
      "source_hash": "89c171682f2fe8297ec48ab4a95a22b530d5c2a82ae1b0cfafe5399233b16a42",
      "target_id": "XML:2703146",
      "text": "规划、分析、设计、开发、运营、维护、咨询、监理或研究开发等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00013",
      "source_hash": "f8f2fd135d07f0819039a74a08be7a6b2aad8da2e288332e225c2b824f6f0c10",
      "target_id": "XML:2703147",
      "text": "信息保护业务的经历，以及信息保护相关咨询或法律咨询经历。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00014",
      "source_hash": "3aa8600fe050d2d7285f1e363e8c7942aeca4acf9323b9535f9021e3ea25c45a",
      "target_id": "XML:2703148",
      "text": "4. 第一号所称“信息技术经历”，是指在公共机构、企业、教育机构及研究机构等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00015",
      "source_hash": "86b1cb3c045b032438d9bb3f320e756b3e73a9481a27c8d0dd6ab2aaf0e7e857",
      "target_id": "XML:2703149",
      "text": "于信息通信服务、信息通信设备、软件及计算机相关服务领域"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00016",
      "source_hash": "0a17c469141c9efa4b025a024199e9b97ef33c282a53b1e8bb3e934f58997b3e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703150",
      "text": "从事规划、分析、设计、开发、运营、维护、咨询、监理或研究开发等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00017",
      "source_hash": "f254c12ae7b243e5504826b1a7a1abf3b9c427c5a565d1bacfa3e7cb5552118f",
      "target_id": "XML:2703151",
      "text": "信息技术业务的经历，以及信息技术相关咨询或法律咨询经历"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00018",
      "source_hash": "581d7432d17a8bb1a9126a9b9d558f65ecda93a65fd3e5b340d55d650b003147",
      "target_id": "XML:2703152",
      "text": "。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00020",
      "target_id": "XML:2703154",
      "source_hash": "fd9c3aed8cf32f047308efbaf882e3fd8bb29ce97575c6fd1c1a177a5ae54bbf",
      "text": "甲. 同一期间有两项以上业务重叠时，仅认可其中一项经历。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00022",
      "target_id": "XML:2703156",
      "source_hash": "b6a6ab8a2c9335b93a57905e49b25b0a6abfe90b6a0fbb9ff127e6d4cb3c5094",
      "text": "乙. 取得个人信息保护、信息保护或信息技术相关学位的，按下表"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00023",
      "target_id": "XML:2703159",
      "source_hash": "4eadd93d072a579d78e71c152ae679761f7ae48536408c53eefe99f726b4a838",
      "text": "所列期间认可相应经历。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00036",
      "target_id": "XML:2703172",
      "source_hash": "dda1c1980f508bded5f860896c440c5aacbb4e4d7b24d8a076328ee3b35150e1",
      "text": "信息技术相关博士学位"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00038",
      "target_id": "XML:2703174",
      "source_hash": "934a726048f62648babf6b100309fe0d290d97db23004aa2d2be10f044fbe7c8",
      "text": "信息技术相关硕士学位"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00040",
      "target_id": "XML:2703176",
      "source_hash": "18f0721d1fdab84660aceca3166d78f3fc7f2220d214e7461e2bb14e4d95faaf",
      "text": "信息技术相关学士学位"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00042",
      "target_id": "XML:2703178",
      "source_hash": "1c56708fdba12dc1908e6a700e2ee2e3f3e4553f09486c725b09674213092c93",
      "text": "，将相关学历折算为工作经历。但取得多个学位的，仅将个人信息"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00043",
      "target_id": "XML:2703179",
      "source_hash": "f6ecaab4b298b6382722f97eba4db866de408ce37e91bf7d47742a2aa9b0ce9c",
      "text": "处理者在拟指定个人信息保护负责人时确定的一项学位认可为经历"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00044",
      "target_id": "XML:2703180",
      "source_hash": "93180b8f4937cabc290aab85bd24b8a626294c3463f6fbefbb7884331ed1f831",
      "text": "。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00045",
      "target_id": "XML:2703181",
      "source_hash": "5cefc613e6076398341a76ac26f25307385378242a004eee6b523cb64604b1c4",
      "text": "丙. 此外，取得保护委员会规定并公告的资格或完成其规定并公告的教育等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00046",
      "target_id": "XML:2703182",
      "source_hash": "3c47b5ef86f5d7cd12c534bb0462b2e4f66590d8c488c84bc83ad2db4372663e",
      "text": "情形，保护委员会应按其规定并公告的标准，将取得的资格或完成的教育等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00047",
      "target_id": "XML:2703183",
      "source_hash": "d4d4aa38a6b45cfad3f38dbc76f74b3b5a8f752c95edeec10f87c12a88d8f1b0",
      "text": "认可为个人信息保护经历、信息保护经历或信息技术经历"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00048",
      "target_id": "XML:2703184",
      "source_hash": "0307ac65416034fdf75185e0ad6ea10f5a61b4e56f71a170efa0931e67f327cd",
      "text": "。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00002",
      "target_id": "XML:2703186",
      "source_hash": "4ecfb1cc902b19d332af8eb2b58a46e61e4e0e0744a1e5759f7666632c6d1ad5",
      "text": "个人信息管理专业机构为履行损害赔偿责任而应投保的最低保险金额或"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00003",
      "target_id": "XML:2703187",
      "source_hash": "13e277b97adc8b5b90408ea48e80cf85677f2ce11620a9cf40b9824776bd8a55",
      "text": "最低准备金提存金额标准（与第四十二条之十一第一款第三号（丙）目有关）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00004",
      "target_id": "XML:2703188",
      "source_hash": "d8ba487317ac4e370c544ff11fee92077c5dfe235d14d8d93e213e278685f7be",
      "text": "类别"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00005",
      "target_id": "XML:2703189",
      "source_hash": "3328da65629c77033806b79916d9c4af096c2c42989061a3aea1ffd2dabf23e0",
      "text": "最低保险金额或最低准备金金额"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00006",
      "target_id": "XML:2703190",
      "source_hash": "5817950975c5e64f267ec347adbb5dc91c45bb6a8e34871c930a7a7a12c58381",
      "text": "中介专业机构及"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00007",
      "target_id": "XML:2703191",
      "source_hash": "e9354ed84880cd76fa761613839b35b6f24e6c15ed61970d8d72d024fddd5a7e",
      "text": "10亿韩元。但依照第四十二条之十第一款申请指定者，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00008",
      "target_id": "XML:2703192",
      "source_hash": "cd1ac28a4daefcbdee2003976399c26958ca999eb9f46ee002b922204245cca5",
      "text": "一般专业机构"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00009",
      "target_id": "XML:2703193",
      "source_hash": "969b500403795248a26542f16da9c3ecf38d983d8ca3c9a944e838b3c70c92c2",
      "text": "如属于第四十二条之十一第二款第二号或第三号的情形，则按"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00010",
      "target_id": "XML:2703194",
      "source_hash": "736a4d07030d7a0ee9370fc0c370db034dc746d9899fd6c86f34f73640a02501",
      "text": "附表1之4规定的最低保险金额（最低准备金金额）执行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00011",
      "target_id": "XML:2703195",
      "source_hash": "c8915ca8c88e6f1f3f719c3a82df6354203bd1a9e9a74c963b07a09b18711600",
      "text": "特殊专业机构"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00012",
      "target_id": "XML:2703196",
      "source_hash": "e9354ed84880cd76fa761613839b35b6f24e6c15ed61970d8d72d024fddd5a7e",
      "text": "10亿韩元。但依照第四十二条之十第一款申请指定者，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00013",
      "target_id": "XML:2703197",
      "source_hash": "a53418582567b5714c4fa005aef36ec8bba28c9a3ba7b0fdbcc7a1b69b10680a",
      "text": "如属于第四十二条之十一第二款各号（第一号仅限于为诊疗目的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00014",
      "target_id": "XML:2703198",
      "source_hash": "a25f8c1281d528327a3623a16fc059c15b5cebe3a5bed48d40e1319f313cf9a1",
      "text": "接收保健医疗传输信息的情形）之一，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00015",
      "target_id": "XML:2703199",
      "source_hash": "aea3f1db4e6ea498e221e1f4e4649ee4e0fcb7566c948cc3f47b9d7de5aebfd5",
      "text": "则按附表1之4规定的最低保险金额（最低准备金金额）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00016",
      "target_id": "XML:2703200",
      "source_hash": "81ea0505654d36669b16c025f9eeef0d98154090b223dccd91cc41477c2f0d6e",
      "text": "执行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00018",
      "target_id": "XML:2703202",
      "source_hash": "a6fdbc1246c2086403bacbd2e867eda24728ec88adbc19dc230dd06b07147e7a",
      "text": "个人信息管理专业机构同时投保保险或加入共济并提存准备金时，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00019",
      "target_id": "XML:2703203",
      "source_hash": "e5241fcb049025bbff387b7c4110aadcba4905c6f91fd2072748c59b6c52a267",
      "text": "保险或共济加入金额与准备金提存金额的合计金额须达到"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37053-zh-00020",
      "target_id": "XML:2703204",
      "source_hash": "7c99417528e273b6e1539c2efb7e455c89c64dfd03011369e586eee3bc428431",
      "text": "上表规定的最低保险金额或最低准备金金额标准。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00002",
      "source_hash": "8deb1de5b52a3b7bc46834cae606ca5f265c4171bb4ec5511b10f0edb22981c9",
      "target_id": "XML:2703206",
      "text": "个人信息管理专业机构的禁止行为（与第四十二条之十三相关）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00003",
      "source_hash": "d7a90755e0d346ff9aaa5c4004e46f82d573b32422ec8932b5ef2e1a276527bb",
      "target_id": "XML:2703207",
      "text": "1. 中介专业机构的禁止行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00004",
      "source_hash": "702e70b3685de2d3a24120434afb2f7a9e53bbf9a859a68453c547c24735150b",
      "target_id": "XML:2703208",
      "text": "甲. 中介专业机构业务终止后，除依照其他法令须保存等正当"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00005",
      "source_hash": "06cebd36458a868189a9f55fca8b650f04297624fdeed00ca2c6c0877f0b85e3",
      "target_id": "XML:2703209",
      "text": "理由外，未依照本法第二十一条销毁个人信息的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00006",
      "source_hash": "e859e57f11ae40ad832bce82369b42b88e1cf24128461dc40ae2d6f5523d8402",
      "target_id": "XML:2703210",
      "text": "乙. 尽管信息主体依照第四十二条之五第六款撤回传输请求，仍未立即中止传输"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00007",
      "source_hash": "bc4ea2855198a7a59ec4e7cb125993dfd97a4f4c79a0e4a87efab841e7c1dac4",
      "target_id": "XML:2703211",
      "text": "程序的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00008",
      "source_hash": "bb18dda4145134fea8d24cf21cb3cb8b05ca37d432d405d5664673d90d600880",
      "target_id": "XML:2703212",
      "text": "丙. 未依照第四十二条之六第十一款制作或保存传输记录的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00009",
      "source_hash": "e24c181d3cdaa4bc0121cf40ce8fb4d31b6671c0d006ae63583389e8b8e004ff",
      "target_id": "XML:2703213",
      "text": "行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00010",
      "source_hash": "72cb42a729297a61165cc0478bce4ba3afc064eb1b538c31972cb8010d7db48e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703214",
      "text": "丁. 依照第四十二条之十二第七款停止或废止部分或全部中介业务时，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00011",
      "source_hash": "faadebdf9b02794ee7e464872eff66cc12c19222ed182160574616d93f87d062",
      "target_id": "XML:2703215",
      "text": "未于预定停止或废止日期六个月前通知指定机关的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00012",
      "source_hash": "335cb99267b7fe77b873f7ee2d0056fbfe2df5b67ae2a714365c9cb87d606626",
      "target_id": "XML:2703217",
      "text": "戊. 以中止传输程序为由，无正当理由要求违约金等经济代价，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00013",
      "source_hash": "11fba4bf1085b98a19d94303dd5cae1a45871306b60e8d5e9717e4dee8742f23",
      "target_id": "XML:2703218",
      "text": "或者要求高于依第四十七条第一款规定的手续费的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00014",
      "source_hash": "d38d082a6259a5280a5433ee8d387c74204c96ce32276a2a51596738e3b69a74",
      "target_id": "XML:2703219",
      "text": "行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00015",
      "source_hash": "8f63f38bb5ce363f4fa6d8463895aa0573ebcf1b17ca42e0b2110036e20c881b",
      "target_id": "XML:2703220",
      "text": "己. 违反第四十七条第一款但书规定的手续费计算标准计算中介手续费，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00016",
      "source_hash": "423246f6c166f00b174848ab6a082c76eef1bce235c727946ab7c6d190ea24ed",
      "target_id": "XML:2703221",
      "text": "或通过篡改计算中介手续费所需基础资料等方法提高"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00017",
      "source_hash": "eb132bbdbb56e611eb8864fba0d59f35c3294b2ef1c4671f465890a4f2083212",
      "target_id": "XML:2703222",
      "text": "中介手续费，从而获得不正当利益的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00018",
      "source_hash": "3b14dc3217832508a38be7662d06cd9ecf82780cd2a4c1cf11a3009d6cf33ef6",
      "target_id": "XML:2703223",
      "text": "庚. 对拟使用中介专业机构的信息传输者、一般专业机构、特殊专业机构及"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00019",
      "source_hash": "db6440c92d6b9b812fb2893be49df76e94b01865ee5f8fd0d1a121f81aa40a9d",
      "target_id": "XML:2703224",
      "text": "一般接收者，无正当理由拒绝中介或区别对待的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00020",
      "source_hash": "4a38c760c6c8abfe19ae2e5b8d239991402903ec25f63f170a32e5c5c8d7226b",
      "target_id": "XML:2703226",
      "text": "辛. 其他与甲目至庚目类似，可能侵害信息主体利益或"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00021",
      "source_hash": "5d6b77d1a709b1cf567b6d024da7689c2e67a023628e86095ab2fd8273f6b629",
      "target_id": "XML:2703227",
      "text": "妨碍传输体系建立，并由保护委员会规定及公告的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00022",
      "source_hash": "28c806c91546e8c2f5e6842bc4d1fcdba0b2464d2cb94668fab83bf6a0e6f7ec",
      "target_id": "XML:2703228",
      "text": "行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00023",
      "source_hash": "ba9cd4697414d2d5d43e43aa202857d08ea7dfc57dc8da957b4f5d96a58d9495",
      "target_id": "XML:2703229",
      "text": "2. 一般专业机构的禁止行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00024",
      "source_hash": "6a3224f72b95fbbf8a2ee19d73c6034152973b19d7bf9ee447474c4a2dc36b0d",
      "target_id": "XML:2703230",
      "text": "甲. 为收集与传输请求目的无关的个人信息，违反本法第十六条第一款而要求传输该信息的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00025",
      "source_hash": "e787254363947bb3fa223ca04469b1946f5e628fd0c406486eb19baeaf8e2809",
      "target_id": "XML:2703232",
      "text": "乙. 并非为本法第十六条第三款规定的服务运营所必需，却在"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00026",
      "source_hash": "58b125702b286e9a6f199c30e5cb393920401bcade8c8988c162cef6610e1132",
      "target_id": "XML:2703233",
      "text": "提出传输请求的同时取得将已接收信息提供给第三方的同意的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00027",
      "source_hash": "db0590d2ad4228913e75cb11871396e88be99a9e9adc25dd9257262eee0549b2",
      "target_id": "XML:2703234",
      "text": "丙. 违反本法第二十一条，在传输请求目的达成后仍保存已接收个人信息的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00028",
      "source_hash": "21041a6699727d6d5cfec822f0e9e8267b59f13f382188d665079ad1033b44ec",
      "target_id": "XML:2703235",
      "text": "行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00029",
      "source_hash": "b8a7fc0aad68f5099a7a4070f4a6e4fa100e68af0f70bab3e155cc75a1226164",
      "target_id": "XML:2703236",
      "text": "丁. 强迫或不正当地诱导代理行使本法第三十八条第一款规定的权利的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00030",
      "source_hash": "d38d082a6259a5280a5433ee8d387c74204c96ce32276a2a51596738e3b69a74",
      "target_id": "XML:2703237",
      "text": "行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00031",
      "source_hash": "8690a5bb06e265675ff90799aded2abf94c7404ee0f882680226fff2759fbaaa",
      "target_id": "XML:2703238",
      "text": "戊. 未经信息主体同意而变更第四十二条之五第三款规定的传输请求内容，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00032",
      "source_hash": "42599632012f9ae6dc7cd3fcc044a582abb87248b9e72226f5a8bc122040bf1e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703239",
      "text": "据此请求个人信息的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00033",
      "source_hash": "6a650a123b326a49acca6bee41df76e444849b99fe58a33d795c4e235c0f9a9e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703240",
      "text": "己. 尽管信息主体依照第四十二条之五第六款提出要求，仍不立即变更或"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00034",
      "source_hash": "b1c90f868adc95f948701db7f3cb990a6bbba3bc179425b33c0747fcc0e954e3",
      "target_id": "XML:2703241",
      "text": "撤回传输请求的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00035",
      "source_hash": "2bd9069b885317b2acfd164a5c1ab729ae9edd4abe24766ff599200c144badea",
      "target_id": "XML:2703242",
      "text": "庚. 因信息主体依照第四十二条之五第六款变更或撤回传输请求，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00036",
      "source_hash": "90d5a0db690a3e82a4e833c87e4795d03fcfef56a18532629064377d7215838e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703243",
      "text": "无正当理由要求违约金等经济代价的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00037",
      "source_hash": "defce97f86ce63319ed37c6eac4cba7d5d8aa86ff52e1aa2e151456c67697853",
      "target_id": "XML:2703244",
      "text": "辛. 规避支付第四十七条第四款规定的个人信息传输手续费的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00038",
      "source_hash": "2c39da6117ec0b1eb608ff741970231ac37fa1972f261703b933e3f7a61f0af5",
      "target_id": "XML:2703245",
      "text": "壬. 强迫或不正当地诱导提出传输请求的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00039",
      "source_hash": "508a2691e66c20280cd42e7dd07cf6a5d481399a06c13fff8e8b1ae805a381a8",
      "target_id": "XML:2703246",
      "text": "癸. 强迫或诱导信息主体不向自身以外的第三方提出传输请求，或强迫撤回对第三方传输请求的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00040",
      "source_hash": "4e3b8801669690a9f449aba5b89afea04d2e29ed1f4c523f3427e893e58a5624",
      "target_id": "XML:2703248",
      "text": "子. 为自身利益，向信息主体推荐或劝诱订立被认定不适合该信息主体的合同的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00041",
      "source_hash": "9be8aaaeb3c2ca50afb93f7a7ee45e297f77956fa3f601e6973647db15fbdbf1",
      "target_id": "XML:2703249",
      "text": "行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00042",
      "source_hash": "bf1374e988c849cf3afda16af13247d1385c20df0fffbaf7275ec45d38e335a1",
      "target_id": "XML:2703250",
      "text": "丑. 为自身或第三方利益而侵害特定信息主体利益的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00043",
      "source_hash": "ba17893a7e872f4af6dcdbeeb10db63776eb08bc8850758ca17537df3db2cc91",
      "target_id": "XML:2703251",
      "text": "寅. 以信息主体提出传输请求为由，持续、反复访问个人信息处理者的计算机设施，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00044",
      "source_hash": "6a6786a3c481cc43eb048961aa064ae21a377897a9ff342c141c0d76200552f0",
      "target_id": "XML:2703252",
      "text": "造成故障的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00045",
      "source_hash": "8a3d9efdde4e131988a6a1836c3024c8a5544c36b770718b8c114ac9955214cd",
      "target_id": "XML:2703253",
      "text": "卯. 其他与甲目至寅目类似，可能侵害信息主体利益或"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00046",
      "source_hash": "5d6b77d1a709b1cf567b6d024da7689c2e67a023628e86095ab2fd8273f6b629",
      "target_id": "XML:2703254",
      "text": "妨碍传输体系建立，并由保护委员会规定及公告的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00047",
      "source_hash": "28c806c91546e8c2f5e6842bc4d1fcdba0b2464d2cb94668fab83bf6a0e6f7ec",
      "target_id": "XML:2703255",
      "text": "行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00048",
      "source_hash": "1ac08a29e4967d7640bdb2f8043eb3611b17b54241a09aa9e242beb382a7ec85",
      "target_id": "XML:2703256",
      "text": "3. 特殊专业机构的禁止行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00049",
      "source_hash": "81c6d7312bccef3a566a1247210edfc624bd10ed5891abea7408ff9c6d98ba7e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703257",
      "text": "甲. 第二号甲目至寅目规定的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00050",
      "source_hash": "7cfff6a7038b2d5437381ce5663c2833b3d08fe171b23c090093b541fa7a2ab1",
      "target_id": "XML:2703258",
      "text": "乙. 以提供金钱利益等为条件诱导信息主体同意传输信息的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00051",
      "source_hash": "8cf25b9b04013a27894a3fa20968bb09ac342f7cb33d16ada590d66062e7f20f",
      "target_id": "XML:2703259",
      "text": "丙. 对《精神健康增进及精神疾病患者福利服务支援相关法律》第三条第一号"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00052",
      "source_hash": "7efaaaf748f7eeeb2cfb2bbed3462f922a1be8da370029254eb398ce06966017",
      "target_id": "XML:2703260",
      "text": "规定的精神疾病患者、《残疾人歧视禁止及权利救济相关法律》第二条"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00053",
      "source_hash": "ce1b59c39df116cd092921c32c3fe16d3a5ee1b31542dce04e072fa5ce88560a",
      "target_id": "XML:2703261",
      "text": "第二款规定的残疾人、《器官等移植相关法律》第四条第二号规定的器官"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00054",
      "source_hash": "01b8c1d02469860e3cdfeffacb41af189565e3929c8f8c296750a906f272543c",
      "target_id": "XML:2703262",
      "text": "等捐献者及《后天性免疫缺陷症预防法》第二条第二号规定的后天性免疫缺陷"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00055",
      "source_hash": "d6f1eace3be446a5d61bb7b0aeb36ec36e48714ab56bbce5b656c074c1d7c105",
      "target_id": "XML:2703263",
      "text": "症患者等实施歧视的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00056",
      "source_hash": "390032bccdb83bfdb8abd2c2458c0a9210a809499afad14a43d89b2675f5f14d",
      "target_id": "XML:2703264",
      "text": "丁. 依照《生命伦理及安全相关法律》第四十六条第一款、第二款及第五十条"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00057",
      "source_hash": "1d71f5e6b1e1d31258a4e18c95fab638d4bd50ff61ef7abff1693535a800754c",
      "target_id": "XML:2703265",
      "text": "规定被禁止或限制的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00058",
      "source_hash": "ce1ad9515eac0f7bcd21c75291478905747bd136e0a3042e91035df61ef0f950",
      "target_id": "XML:2703266",
      "text": "戊. 其他与甲目至丁目类似，可能侵害信息主体利益或"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00059",
      "source_hash": "5d6b77d1a709b1cf567b6d024da7689c2e67a023628e86095ab2fd8273f6b629",
      "target_id": "XML:2703267",
      "text": "妨碍传输体系建立，并由保护委员会规定及公告的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00060",
      "source_hash": "28c806c91546e8c2f5e6842bc4d1fcdba0b2464d2cb94668fab83bf6a0e6f7ec",
      "target_id": "XML:2703268",
      "text": "行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37055-zh-00002",
      "source_hash": "7665e1bbdc403702022ae9ee767fecb2782a4949fa7c0bb72c4277973bba5562",
      "target_id": "XML:2703270",
      "text": "为履行损害赔偿责任而投保的最低保险金额（最低准备金金额）标准（第四十八条之七第四款"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37055-zh-00003",
      "source_hash": "e3f7b29f4ca4e84c66957cb8a69ee55d09a7eaede18abf66a9fb2fecdc9d172a",
      "target_id": "XML:2703271",
      "text": "相关）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37055-zh-00004",
      "source_hash": "4698028da7597b818c92995fab73ea54fa47c4fb3661dabc701d081ea035a0e5",
      "target_id": "XML:2703272",
      "text": "须投保的个人信息处理者保险金额计算因素"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37055-zh-00005",
      "source_hash": "5f1bc80f256d5732150dafe04a96f10e8de9434227f3de17e97a35cc59146d54",
      "target_id": "XML:2703273",
      "text": "最低保险金额"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37055-zh-00006",
      "source_hash": "93c4bde752836fd65e47c316bf7c2d19fd66f2838f632cf07cb6b634defd4558",
      "target_id": "XML:2703274",
      "text": "（最低准备金金额）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37055-zh-00007",
      "source_hash": "080560a76dbc668ffc705240659bf3793915e13ac1ca6f60f33751b673eb9b20",
      "target_id": "XML:2703275",
